SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Pre-Karaoke Dinner Party!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nJoin us for a fun and relaxed Saturday night of great food\, wonderful 
 conversations and always new connections! Come on your own or bring a frie
 nd and enjoy an easy going autumn evening with new and old friends alike.\
 n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulo
 us turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our weekend with!\n\n\\*P
 lease note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (r
 oughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back
  dining area or on the patio\, depending on weather and numbers)**\n\n*\\*
 You can ask the bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask
  for Steve's dinner party)*\n\n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjo
 yable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free Parking found on residential side streets**\n
 \n(Event Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host 
 )\n\nEvent Details:\n**🎉** **The Saturday Night Pre-Karaoke Dinner Part
 y!**\n\nWe’re getting together at The Pheasant on Avenue Road for our **
 Saturday Night Pre-Karaoke Dinner Party!**\nThis is a casual social evenin
 g where you can enjoy dinner and drinks while meeting new people in a comf
 ortable and friendly atmosphere. Whether you're new to the group or one of
  our regulars\, you're very welcome to join us.\n\n• 🍽️ Enjoy dinne
 r and drinks\n• 🍂 Relaxed autumn social atmosphere\n• 👋 Meet new
  people and make new friends\n• 💬 Plenty of time to mix\, mingle and 
 chat\n• 👫 Singles\, couples and friends are all welcome\n• 😊 Com
 e alone — many of our members do!\n\nLooking forward to another enjoyabl
 e Saturday night together!\nHosted by Steve Flemming (Soul City Social Clu
 b)\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor
  by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for thos
 e attending Music Bingo :)\n\\*No extra charge if you are staying for Kara
 oke as well :)\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 6:30
  pm and 7:30 pm (please ask for Steve when you arrive)\n\n\\*Great dinner 
 menu and food specials provided:\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lo
 ts of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.f
 irkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Law
 rence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
