SUMMARY:The Hunter's Moon October Karaoke Bash! (October 24th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nGet ready to sing\, laugh and celebrate the season at **The Hunter's Mo
 on October Karaoke Bash!** Whether you’re a confident performer\, a casu
 al singalong fan or someone who simply enjoys great company\, come join us
  for a lively night of music\, drinks and friendly conversation.\n\n\\*Joi
 ned by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn o
 ut with lots of friendly peers to enjoy karaoke with!\n\n\\*Please note we
  are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 bloc
 ks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(we are in the back dining area 
 to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wait staff or bartender if you l
 ike to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's games event)*\n\n**-F
 ree Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n
 \nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEvent Details:\n**Th
 e Hunter's Moon October Karaoke Bash! (Saturday\, October 24th)**\n\n-Octo
 ber is here\, and we’re celebrating with an howlin' evening of karaoke a
 nd new connections! Choose an old favourite\, try something unexpected or 
 relax with a drink while cheering on the singers.\nYou don’t need a perf
 ect voice or any karaoke experience—This event is about having fun\, mee
 ting friendly people and enjoying the moment. Come alone\, bring a friend 
 or invite a group. We’ll help everyone feel welcome!\n**Evening highligh
 ts:**\n\n* Karaoke favourites from every decade\n* A relaxed and supportiv
 e atmosphere\n* Cocktails\, beer\, soft drinks and food available for purc
 hase\n* Opportunities to meet new people\n* Plenty of music\, laughter and
  autumn fun\n* Two mics for duets as well :)\n\nPlease be respectful of th
 e venue\, performers and fellow guests. Everyone is encouraged to particip
 ate\, but singing is always optional.\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming — Soul
  City Social Club**\n\n***\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 dollars (Cash only at the 
 door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n*
 **\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time after 7:30 pm (in the ba
 ck area- great for board games\, card games and mingling) (event goes to r
 oughly 12:00 am)\n\n\\*Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(Two
  beverage or beverage and an appetizer minimum to support the venue at thi
 s great event)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*Lots of street parki
 ng on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps://www.firkinpubs.com/thep
 heasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway stati
 on-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
