SUMMARY:Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 I'd like to invite you out to a fun-filled afternoon with this fantastic s
 ocial game called **MUSIC BINGO with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nEv
 eryone can play (It's easy to learn and most of all it's a lot of fun!)\n\
 n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous
  turn out\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 19
 99 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(w
 e are in the back dining area to find us)**\n\n*\\*You can also ask the wa
 it staff or bartender if you like to show you to the group (simply ask for
  Steve's games event)*\n\nEvent Details Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Fle
 mming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Details of Event:**\n
 **Music Bingo with Friends! (Best of 7 Decades!)**\n\nMusic Bingo puts a f
 un musical twist on traditional bingo. Instead of listening for numbers\, 
 you'll hear familiar songs from across the decades and mark them off on yo
 ur Music Bingo card.\n\nYou don't need to be a music expert — recognizin
 g the songs\, singing along and enjoying the company is all part of the fu
 n!\n\n• **Seven decades of great music** with plenty of familiar favouri
 tes\n• **Treats for our winning participants** during the different roun
 ds\n• **Meet and mingle** with a friendly group while enjoying a relaxed
  social atmosphere\n• **Come on your own or invite some friends** — we
 'll get everyone settled in and ready to play\n\n**Event Fee: $10**\nYour 
 event fee includes **Music Bingo\, treats for our winners\, reserved seati
 ng and plenty of music\, laughs and fun throughout the event.**\nPayment c
 an be made **in cash at the event** or **in advance by e-transfer to [Stev
 eFlemming11@gmail.com](mailto:SteveFlemming11@gmail.com)**.\nIf paying by 
 e-transfer\, please include **your name** in the message so your payment c
 an be easily identified.\n\nBring your music memories\, your sense of humo
 ur and maybe even your singing voice — although singing along is complet
 ely optional!\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\nPlease arrive between **3:00 P
 M and 3:30 PM** so you'll have time to get settled\, meet some people and 
 get ready to play. **Music Bingo will begin shortly afterward.**\n\n\\*Gre
 at lunch menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer mini
 mum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\n\\*
 Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\n[https://ww
 w.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/](https://www.firkinpubs.com/thephea
 santandfirkin/)\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge & Lawrence subway station-o
 r simply take bus or uber from the station)
