SUMMARY:The Friday Night Mix\, Mingle and Games! (November 13th)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nPlease join us for a fun\, interactive and enjoyable evening at this wo
 nderful\, cozy Firkin Pub location to play some absolute classics like ***
